{"ID":"20251112115823-xlkgzry","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251112115823-xlkgzry","title":"UPL9-10——减少 Shader 采样开销","type":"doc","updated":"20251112164111"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112115824-fdlgkmp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251112115824-fdlgkmp","updated":"20251112115924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少纹理采样"}]},{"ID":"20251112115853-6uqn8hu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112115853-6uqn8hu","updated":"20251112115859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"纹理采样是所有内存带宽开销的核心消耗"}]},{"ID":"20251112115859-h647x68","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251112115859-h647x68","updated":"20251112115859"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112115859-lwl1pik","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251112115859-lwl1pik","updated":"20251112115859"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112115859-9o3win0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112115859-9o3win0","updated":"20251112115859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用的纹理越少、分辨率越合适，缓存命中率更高，带宽占用更低，性能更好"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112115900-o4ra32r","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251112115900-o4ra32r","updated":"20251112115900"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112115900-36vnvka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112115900-36vnvka","updated":"20251112115900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用的纹理越多，则在调用过程中缓存丢失的情况就越多"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112115901-9o7qqsu","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251112115901-9o7qqsu","updated":"20251112115901"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112115901-vpmshqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112115901-vpmshqb","updated":"20251112115901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"制作的纹理越大，将它们传输到纹理缓冲消耗的内存带宽就越多"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251112115858-x25c4xj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112115858-x25c4xj","updated":"20251112115905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此我们应该尽量的杜绝这些情况的发生，避免产生 GPU 瓶颈"}]},{"ID":"20251112115853-2hfo72i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112115853-2hfo72i","updated":"20251112115922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如我们可以通过把多个纹理合并成一张纹理的方式，\n有效的减少纹理采样：可以把 金属度、粗糙度、环境光遮蔽 三张黑白图 打包到一张 RGBA 纹理的 RGB 通道中"}]},{"ID":"20251112115924-vv0oqjb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251112115924-vv0oqjb","updated":"20251112162604"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用更少的纹理数据"}]},{"ID":"20251112115934-2mpctxx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112115934-2mpctxx","updated":"20251112115938"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每次采样传输的数据量越小，显存带宽和缓存压力就越小\n我们可以通过降低分辨率、减少通道的方式，去掉用不到的高精度"}]},{"ID":"20251112115934-ykcd9l5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112115934-ykcd9l5","updated":"20251112115945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如我们可以用 R8 格式代替 RGBA32 格式\n遮罩贴图只需要一个灰度通道，用 R8 格式即可"}]},{"ID":"20251112115951-o9zgogl","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251112115951-o9zgogl","updated":"20251112162604"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112115951-3s237gd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251112115951-3s237gd","updated":"20251112162604"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112115934-bbzw8ne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112115934-bbzw8ne","updated":"20251112115934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"R8:"}]},{"ID":"20251112115952-vjc5fg8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112115952-vjc5fg8","updated":"20251112162604"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每个像素只存储一个通道（R 通道）\n每个像素 8 位 = 1 字节"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112115951-mnygpkh","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251112115951-mnygpkh","updated":"20251112115951"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112115934-iq3sntc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112115934-iq3sntc","updated":"20251112115934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"RGBA32:"}]},{"ID":"20251112115954-qai9of4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112115954-qai9of4","updated":"20251112120004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每个像素存储四个通道（RGBA 通道）\n每个像素 32 位 = 4 字节"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251112120007-dzveoq0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251112120007-dzveoq0","updated":"20251112162916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"测试不同 GPU 纹理压缩格式"}]},{"ID":"20251112120031-evhjh1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120031-evhjh1g","updated":"20251112162808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 中不同的纹理压缩格式，能减少程序的磁盘空间以及运行时 CPU、内存使用率\n这些压缩格式都是为具体平台的 GPU 架构设计的，压缩格式有很多，比如：DXT、PVRTC、ETC、ETC2、ASTC 等等"}]},{"ID":"20251112162806-5lkkkyj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112162806-5lkkkyj","updated":"20251112162916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251112162916-9h8xin2.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251112162805-04pflc0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112162805-04pflc0","updated":"20251112162805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是在不同的平台上能选择的压缩格式有所不同，比如："}]},{"ID":"20251112120047-wj47djx","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251112120047-wj47djx","updated":"20251112120053"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112120047-dow6upi","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251112120047-dow6upi","updated":"20251112120047"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112120047-y4m4w62","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120047-y4m4w62","updated":"20251112120047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"PC：BC 系列"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112120047-9p7jewk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251112120047-9p7jewk","updated":"20251112120052"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112120047-t9lnt5x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120047-t9lnt5x","updated":"20251112120052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Android：ETC2 / ASTC"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112120048-y09hu0h","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251112120048-y09hu0h","updated":"20251112120053"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112120048-0wk7pdq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120048-0wk7pdq","updated":"20251112120053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"iOS：PVRTC / ASTC"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251112120031-nzb6s44","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120031-nzb6s44","updated":"20251112120057"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们应该在不同平台测试不同格式，选出兼顾视觉和性能表现的格式进行使用\n虽然 Unity 在不同平台都推荐了对应的格式，但是我们完全可以根据自己的需求\n局部性的修改部分纹理的压缩格式，能带来更多的性能提升！"}]},{"ID":"20251112120031-q0o8u6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120031-q0o8u6w","updated":"20251112120248"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 压缩格式说明："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://docs.unity3d.com/cn/current/Manual/class-TextureImporterOverride.html","TextMarkTextContent":"https://docs.unity3d.com/cn/current/Manual/class-TextureImporterOverride.html"}]},{"ID":"20251112120147-izsn1gv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251112120147-izsn1gv","updated":"20251112120245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最小化纹理交换"}]},{"ID":"20251112120156-rlram4t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120156-rlram4t","updated":"20251112120200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果内存带宽存在问题，就需要减少正在进行的纹理采样量\n并且频繁绑定不同纹理会刷新 GPU 的纹理缓存，导致 缓存丢失，更耗带宽\n我们可以通过以下方式降低纹理采样量和交换频率"}]},{"ID":"20251112120200-cbz5t4l","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251112120200-cbz5t4l","updated":"20251112120240"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112120200-8z2ib85","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251112120200-8z2ib85","updated":"20251112120200"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112120200-0hzgun8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120200-0hzgun8","updated":"20251112120200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"降低纹理分辨率（可能会牺牲表现效果，谨慎使用）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112120200-79asl9c","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251112120200-79asl9c","updated":"20251112120200"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112120200-v5xd1e3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120200-v5xd1e3","updated":"20251112120200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"重复使用纹理（利用不同着色器渲染不同效果）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112120200-prd9hf5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251112120200-prd9hf5","updated":"20251112120200"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112120200-pvufba9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120200-pvufba9","updated":"20251112120200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"纹理合并图集（减少纹理交换次数）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112120200-ij3ndug","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251112120200-ij3ndug","updated":"20251112120240"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112120200-j8xsix9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120200-j8xsix9","updated":"20251112120240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少在一个 Pass 或者 DrawCall 间频繁切换大纹理"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251112120158-txfpy3b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120158-txfpy3b","updated":"20251112120158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20251112120245-xlpgr1h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251112120245-xlpgr1h","updated":"20251112120315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"VRAM（显存）限制"}]},{"ID":"20251112120258-5mpqxpb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120258-5mpqxpb","updated":"20251112120312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显存不足会导致驱动把纹理换入换出（释放显存中老纹理，载入新纹理），会造成采样时卡顿，即便没有内存溢出，大纹理也会拖慢显存带宽\n我们应该控制项目的显存预算，避免大纹理和冗余贴图的使用"}]},{"ID":"20251112120310-plcfc2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120310-plcfc2j","updated":"20251112120310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如：移动端项目尽量把总贴图内存控制在 500MB 以下"}]},{"ID":"20251112120315-v7brhlo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251112120315-v7brhlo","updated":"20251112163552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用 Mipmap 并正确过滤"}]},{"ID":"20251112120328-s076cad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120328-s076cad","updated":"20251112120342"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对于离摄像机很远的对象，如果一直使用大分辨率纹理，会带来多余带宽消耗，甚至带来画面闪烁\n我们可以通过开启 Mipmap，在采样时使用线性（linear）或者三线性（trilinear）\n这样不仅可以降低显存的带宽消耗，还可以减少锯齿，提升画质"}]},{"ID":"20251112120328-85mxizt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120328-85mxizt","updated":"20251112120413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为何会画面闪烁：\n当物体离得很远时，一个屏幕像素可能对应 很多个纹理像素，如果没有 Mipmap，GPU 仍然从 最高分辨率的原始贴图里采样\n就可能出现 在像素点和纹理点之间采样跳来跳去，会出现 锯齿、闪烁、莫尔条纹，\nMipmap 实际上起到了 低通滤波 的作用，去掉了超过屏幕采样率的高频细节"}]},{"ID":"20251112120328-zmbwsa3","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251112120328-zmbwsa3","updated":"20251112163552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251112120348-opvp2lr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120348-opvp2lr","updated":"20251112120355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莫尔条纹：当两个 高频的规则图案（例如网格、条纹、点阵）叠加时，因采样不足或频率接近而产生的 干涉花纹"}]},{"ID":"20251112120401-n3e2qap","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120401-n3e2qap","updated":"20251112120401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如："}]},{"ID":"20251112120357-ezxnebv","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251112120357-ezxnebv","updated":"20251112120358"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112120358-a9gh03w","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251112120358-a9gh03w","updated":"20251112120358"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112120358-g6ysdgv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120358-g6ysdgv","updated":"20251112120358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"电视、电脑屏幕中出现的波浪纹"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112120359-p2zlxwv","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251112120359-p2zlxwv","updated":"20251112120359"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112120359-m3pbvdy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120359-m3pbvdy","updated":"20251112120359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在游戏里看远处的格子地砖、栅栏,会出现水波纹状的图案"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251112163244-xeutak8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112163244-xeutak8","updated":"20251112163552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251112163552-3tw2ntk.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112120638-ins8vjr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251112120638-ins8vjr","updated":"20251112134659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采样复用"}]},{"ID":"20251112120643-zcbj0if","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120643-zcbj0if","updated":"20251112120705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"建议一次纹理采样的结果尽量多次使用，而不是重复采样\n或者把多个数据打包到同一张贴图中，一次采样取多种信息（知识点一中的减少纹理采样方式）"}]},{"ID":"20251112120708-iex1kzi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120708-iex1kzi","updated":"20251112120717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们每次从纹理中采样都可能走一个完整的流程：显存 → 缓存 → 纹理单元 → 插值滤波\n即使从缓存中获取内容也是有开销的，因此我们应该避免重复采样"}]},{"ID":"20251112120720-ee5gmkt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120720-ee5gmkt","updated":"20251112120723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如："}]},{"ID":"20251112120647-nnhcyt3","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251112120647-nnhcyt3","updated":"20251112120655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"float4 albedo1 = SAMPLE_TEXTURE2D(_MainTex, sampler_MainTex, uv);\nfloat rough1 = SAMPLE_TEXTURE2D(_MainTex, sampler_MainTex, uv).a;\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20251112120646-59hzs5y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112120646-59hzs5y","updated":"20251112120658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"应该改为"}]},{"ID":"20251112120659-2fftn8h","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251112120659-2fftn8h","updated":"20251112120700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"float4 tex = SAMPLE_TEXTURE2D(_MainTex, sampler_MainTex, uv);\nfloat3 albedo = tex.rgb;\nfloat rough = tex.a;\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20251112134659-32y0thj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251112134659-32y0thj","updated":"20251112164017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"避免动态分支选择纹理"}]},{"ID":"20251112134708-sl59hit","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112134708-sl59hit","updated":"20251112134738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"建议不要在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"if/else"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 分支语句中进行采样，比如："}]},{"ID":"20251112134728-smt4b53","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251112134728-smt4b53","updated":"20251112134732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"if (条件)\n  tex2D(texA, uv);\nelse\n  tex2D(texB, uv);\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20251112134725-hpcl7ol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112134725-hpcl7ol","updated":"20251112134744"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为由于 GPU 的并行架构，动态分支可能会导致两个分支都执行，就会造成两个纹理都采样，反而会更慢\n动态分支选择纹理 ≈ GPU 并不会真的只执行一条分支，所以会浪费采样"}]},{"ID":"20251112134708-wzxv9ot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112134708-wzxv9ot","updated":"20251112134801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们应该通过"}]},{"ID":"20251112134801-28dl1zu","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251112134801-28dl1zu","updated":"20251112134847"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112134801-9qurw43","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251112134801-9qurw43","updated":"20251112134801"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112134801-7tjcp0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112134801-7tjcp0s","updated":"20251112134801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"纹理图集"}]},{"ID":"20251112134802-4kksuqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112134802-4kksuqq","updated":"20251112134806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"把多张小贴图打到一张大图里，CPU 侧把本次要用的子矩形转换成 scale、offset 传给材质\n着色器直接用重映射后的 UV 采样 同一张纹理"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112134801-0c09v6c","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251112134801-0c09v6c","updated":"20251112134801"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112134801-lde3cir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112134801-lde3cir","updated":"20251112134814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Texture2DArray"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251112134817-feuf82d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112134817-feuf82d","updated":"20251112134828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"把同尺寸、同格式的多张纹理打包成 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Texture2DArray"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，着色器用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"float3(uv, layerIndex)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 采样"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112134801-u0g8ia1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251112134801-u0g8ia1","updated":"20251112134847"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112134801-pbqyklr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112134801-pbqyklr","updated":"20251112134801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关键字产生变体"}]},{"ID":"20251112134835-lcnn5zn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112134835-lcnn5zn","updated":"20251112134847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"利用 Shader 中的关键字生成 Shader 变体，编译两个版本，运行时根据关键字选择执行的 Shader 版本"}]},{"ID":"20251112163831-tcp8kba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112163831-tcp8kba","updated":"20251112163858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"具体可见："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250128170153-so50dgr","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"US5L3——Shader变体和关键字"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251112163937-ieimy5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112163937-ieimy5t","updated":"20251112164017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其中，2 和 3 是为了解决并行性的问题，和 1 的原理不一样"}]},{"ID":"20251112134711-yirzbcs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112134711-yirzbcs","updated":"20251112134711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20251112134849-o9v73xp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251112134849-o9v73xp","updated":"20251112135129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"压缩法线纹理"}]},{"ID":"20251112134903-d5n3cas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112134903-d5n3cas","updated":"20251112134928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"法线贴图通常是 RGB 或 RGBA32，每像素 24 位 3 字节 或 32 位 4 字节，开销大\n但是法线数据的特点是：只需要保持方向向量的精度，不需要颜色准确\n所以可以用专门的纹理压缩格式来大幅减少显存占用和带宽"}]},{"ID":"20251112134931-xvgxvxr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112134931-xvgxvxr","updated":"20251112135114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"基本原理：法线其实是一个三维向量 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"(x,y,z)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，但可以只存两个分量 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"(x,y)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\n再在 Shader 里用公式重建，公式 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"n.z = sqrt(saturate(1 - n.x * n.x - n.y * n.y));"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\n这样可以用 RG 两通道存储，而不是 RGB(A)"}]},{"ID":"20251112134942-6zzocnn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112134942-6zzocnn","updated":"20251112134953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 内的专用压缩格式："}]},{"ID":"20251112134953-9wyt7hj","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251112134953-9wyt7hj","updated":"20251112134959"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112134953-92swu91","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251112134953-92swu91","updated":"20251112134959"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112134953-27jgsp6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112134953-27jgsp6","updated":"20251112134959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"BC5、ATI2：两个通道独立压缩，精度足够恢复法线方向，常用，主要针对 PC 和主机"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112134954-8jccbhw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251112134954-8jccbhw","updated":"20251112134954"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112134954-ki86poc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112134954-ki86poc","updated":"20251112134954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ASTC、ETC2_RG：支持更灵活的压缩方式，能兼顾效果和性能，主要针对移动端"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251112134952-cuo4u25","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112134952-cuo4u25","updated":"20251112134952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20251112134951-quaqtd5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112134951-quaqtd5","updated":"20251112135124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通过压缩法线贴图可以减少 50%~75% 的存储和带宽"}]},{"ID":"20251112135129-e2s4pny","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251112135129-e2s4pny","updated":"20251112164111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"流式加载"}]},{"ID":"20251112135137-7nnpvkt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112135137-7nnpvkt","updated":"20251112164107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对于一些大型游戏来说，单个场景中可能会有几个 GB 的贴图\n如果我们一次性的全部加载进显存，可能会造成卡顿甚至内存溢出直接闪退\n而流式加载就是来解决这个问题的"}]},{"ID":"20251112135149-i747tb6","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251112135149-i747tb6","updated":"20251112135338"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112135149-ga7kwgx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251112135149-ga7kwgx","updated":"20251112135338"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112135149-r6i43cz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112135149-r6i43cz","updated":"20251112135226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虚拟纹理"}]},{"ID":"20251112135159-jxmmbyo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112135159-jxmmbyo","updated":"20251112135201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"将超大纹理分割成很多小块，运行时只加载摄像机能看到的块"}]},{"ID":"20251112135228-4qw7ic1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112135228-4qw7ic1","updated":"20251112135338"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"详细可见："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250903201222-ho9h4t0","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"UPL2-13——Virtual Texturing 模块"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112135149-wtygla9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251112135149-wtygla9","updated":"20251112135149"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112135149-kakw9vq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112135149-kakw9vq","updated":"20251112135223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 自带的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20230727202308-tdqbyqi","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Streaming Mipmaps"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 功能"}]},{"ID":"20251112135203-i4v35m8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112135203-i4v35m8","updated":"20251112135210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU 只保留必要的 mip 层，远处加载低分辨率 mip，近处加载高分辨率 mip"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251112135140-umv1d52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112135140-umv1d52","updated":"20251112135142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"并且这些流式加载功能往往是通过异步加载的方式进行的，这样可以避免主线程卡顿"}]},{"ID":"20251112164111-kigvy3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112164111-kigvy3l","updated":"20251112164111"}}]}